WEBVTT

00:00:26.451 --> 00:00:30.746
of a new and widespread
collective understanding

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:32.906
of our connection to the natural world,

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.736
the consequences of ignoring science

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:40.580
and our sacred obligation
to build a just society for all.

00:00:40.926 --> 00:00:44.600
The Climate Reality Project
trains thousands of climate leaders

00:00:44.624 --> 00:00:48.196
around the world, in all 195 nations,

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:50.946
to advocate for a future
humanity deserves.

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:54.397
You're about to hear
from four very different people

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:56.456
who've gone through
this week-long training

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:59.486
and hear how they've been inspired to act.